      }
     },
     {
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Hey!",
       "transl": "Huch!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     null,
     null,
     null,
     {
      "thenStep": [
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Pleased ter meetcher, girl!",
         "transl": "Isch verdammt gu'd dich zu treffe', Mädle!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hi!",
         "transl": "Привіт!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "EXCITED"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Are y'all inner'sted in plants too?",
         "transl": "Seid's ihr all' auch an Gewäggs' endressierd?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[nickt]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       }
      ],
      "elseStep": [
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Good gracious, girl!",
         "transl": "Desch isch verdammt großzügig, Mädle!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hi!",
         "transl": "Привіт!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "EXCITED"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Y'all gave me quite the scare there.",
         "transl": "Ihr habt's mir ganz schön 'n Schock einjejagt."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hittin' them plants an' all.",
         "transl": "Mit de' ganze Gewäggse kloppe un so."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...!",
         "transl": "...!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Shucks, 'sall good.",
         "transl": "Ach nah, isch alles subba."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "They got some mighty strange doohickeys inside, don'tcher think?",
       "transl": "Die lasse ganz schön seltsames Zeug fallen, wa?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED_AWAY"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
       "transl": "[nickt]"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Well, Ah'm \\c[3]Talatu Lips\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Mei Nam' isch \\c[3]Talatu Lips\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "name": {
       "orig": "Talatu Lips",
       "transl": "Talatu Lips"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Ah've takin' a notion ta findin' an' analyzin' as many as ah can. ",
       "transl": "Isch habbet mia zum Aufgäble jemacht, so viel fia di Analyse wie nur möchlich zu finden."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "But that's turned out ta be a lot harder than ah 'spected.",
       "transl": "Wus sisch als rescht schwer herausgestelld hat."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "See, gettin' at what's inside seems ta only be doable by Seekers. ",
       "transl": "Weischt, rauszufinde was inne drinne isch, des könne scheinbah' nur de' Seeker."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Ah can only collec' what they bring me.",
       "transl": "Un isch kann nuar sammel, was die mi bringe."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ASTONISHED"
      }
     },
     {
      "thenStep": [
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Might y'all be inner'sted in givin' me a hand?",
         "transl": "Isch des für disch von Intressle?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ],
      "elseStep": [
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Y'all already seem ta know the drill. ",
         "transl": "Du schaust aus, als kennste disch aus."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Care ta help me out?",
         "transl": "Mogscht helfe?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "accepted": [
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...!",
         "transl": "...!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "EXCITED"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[nickt]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Much obliged, girl, that there's mighty kind o' y'all.",
         "transl": "Schick, blauhaarig's Mädel, desch is fei nett von dir!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "First, lemme give y'all this here...",
         "transl": "Lass mir des mal dir gebe."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       null,
       {
        "object": {
         "orig": "\\v[item.285.name]",
         "transl": "Florascheibe"
        }
       },
       null,
       null,
       {
        "name": {
         "orig": "Talatu Lips",
         "transl": "Talatu Lips"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "This handy li'l gizmo will help y'all keep track o' yer progress. ",
         "transl": "Die kleine Disc mocht's mi möchlisch, dei Fortschritt zu sehe."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Jes' keep hittin' them plants an' analyze 'em by gettin' them doohickeys. ",
         "transl": "All's was de tun muscht, is de Gewäggse ordentlisch kloppe. Und se analysiere, wenn 'de dere Zeusch einsammel tust."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Y'all can check yer progress in the menu too!",
         "transl": "Du kansch de Fortschritt auch selbsch nachgucke, im Menü."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Ah took the liberty of addin' mah findin's fer the \\c[3]Alpha Ball Plant\\c[0].",
         "transl": "Isch hab mir mal de Freiheit genomme, mei Ergebnisse über de \\c[3]Alpha-Kugelpflanze\\c[0] hinzuzufüge."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Jes' keep hittin' them plants fer me, a'right?",
         "transl": "Hau nur fleißsch auf de Planze für mich, tuscht des, ja?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[nickt]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Alrighty, Ah'll be off explorin' fer more o' them plants. ",
         "transl": "Schick, schick. Isch werde ma' mehr von den Gewäggse suche'."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Might even meetcher again along the way. ",
         "transl": "Möglisch, dass me uns wieda sehe, wa?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Once y'all're finished, come find me in \\c[3]Rookie Harbor Alley Quarters\\c[0]. ",
         "transl": "Wenn de feddisch bisch, findest mich in de \\c[3]Rookie Harbor Alleenviertel\\c[0]."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ],
      "declined": [
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NERVOUS"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[shakes head]",
         "transl": "[schüttelt Kopf]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SHAKE"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Well bless yer heart, girl, y'all come back if y'ever change yer mind.",
         "transl": "Oh, keine Sorge, Mädel, desch is kei Problem. Wenn de' dei' Meinung änderscht, kannst wieda komme, wa?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "greenies.female-researcher",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
